#: OldView.cpp:200
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>These are the <img src=\"small|exec\"/> <strong>services</strong> "
"available on your computer. To start a service, drag it onto the "
"<em>Start</em> section of a runlevel.</p>"
"<p>To stop one, do the same for the <em>Stop</em> section.</p>"
msgstr ""
"Eses son os <bold>servicios dispoñibles</bold>\n"
"Para iniciar un servicio, arrástreo á sección <bold>\"Iniciar\"</bold> "
"dun nivel de execución.\n"
"\n"
"Para detelo, faga o mesmo para á sección <bold>\"Deter\"</bold>."

#: OldView.cpp:244
msgid ""
"<p>You can drag services from a runlevel onto the <img src=\"small|trash\"/>"
" <strong>trashcan</strong> to delete them from that runlevel.</p>"
"<p>The <strong>Undo command</strong> can be used to restore deleted "
"entries.</p>"
msgstr ""

